 "reviews": [
  {
   "stars": "★★★★★",
   "text": "“I absolutely adore this place. The food is always delicious and fresh, the service is quick and friendly even during the lunch rush, and it's not too expensive considering the location. Absolutely recommend the sushi and rice dishes. The pho is okay.”",
